<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head') %>
    <title>Inventario · Restaurant Martin</title>
    <style>
        .stockbar { height: 6px; background: #eef2f7; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; width: 110px; }
        .stockbar > span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--rm-ok); }
        .stockbar.bajo > span { background: var(--rm-danger); }
        .nav-pills .nav-link.active { background: var(--rm-ink); }
        .nav-pills .nav-link { color: var(--rm-ink); font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="rm">
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    <main class="rm-page container pb-5">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-start justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
            <div>
                <h1 class="rm-title h3"><i class="bi bi-box-seam me-2" style="color:var(--rm-accent)"></i>Inventario</h1>
                <p class="rm-sub">Los insumos se descuentan solos al facturar, según la receta de cada plato.</p>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-rm" id="btnNuevoInsumo"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Nuevo insumo</button>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-3 mb-3" id="kpis"></div>

        <ul class="nav nav-pills mb-3 gap-1" role="tablist">
            <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#tabInsumos" type="button">Insumos</button></li>
            <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#tabRecetas" type="button">Recetas y costeo</button></li>
            <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#tabMovs" type="button" id="btnTabMovs">Movimientos</button></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tab-content">
            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tabInsumos">
                <div class="rm-card">
                    <div class="rm-card-h">
                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="buscarInsumo" placeholder="Buscar insumo…" style="max-width:260px">
                        <div class="form-check form-switch ms-auto mb-0">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="soloBajos">
                            <label class="form-check-label small" for="soloBajos">Solo stock bajo</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table rm-table">
                            <thead><tr><th>Insumo</th><th class="text-end">Stock</th><th></th><th class="text-end">Mínimo</th><th class="text-end">Costo por unidad</th><th class="text-end">Consumo 7 días</th><th class="text-end">Acciones</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="tbInsumos"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabRecetas">
                <div class="rm-card">
                    <div class="rm-card-h"><input class="form-control form-control-sm" id="buscarProd" placeholder="Buscar plato…" style="max-width:260px"></div>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table rm-table">
                            <thead><tr><th>Plato</th><th class="text-end">Precio</th><th class="text-end">Costo receta</th><th class="text-end">Margen</th><th class="text-end"></th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="tbCosteo"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabMovs">
                <div class="rm-card">
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table rm-table">
                            <thead><tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Insumo</th><th>Tipo</th><th class="text-end">Cantidad</th><th class="text-end">Stock después</th><th>Nota</th><th>Usuario</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="tbMovs"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Modal insumo -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modalInsumo" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="modal-dialog">
            <form class="modal-content" id="formInsumo">
                <div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title" id="tituloInsumo">Nuevo insumo</h5><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Cerrar"></button></div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <input type="hidden" id="iId">
                    <div class="row g-2">
                        <div class="col-8"><label class="form-label small" for="iNombre">Nombre</label><input id="iNombre" class="form-control" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Ej: Carne de res, Arroz, Coca-Cola 350ml"></div>
                        <div class="col-4"><label class="form-label small" for="iUnidad">Unidad</label>
                            <input id="iUnidad" class="form-control" list="unidades" value="und" maxlength="20">
                            <datalist id="unidades"><option value="und"><option value="kg"><option value="lb"><option value="g"><option value="oz"><option value="l"><option value="ml"><option value="gal"><option value="porción"></datalist>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 small text-muted" id="iAyudaUnidad"><i class="bi bi-arrows-expand-vertical"></i> Puedes usar <b>kg</b> o <b>lb</b> (libras). Si cambias la unidad de un insumo ya creado (por ejemplo de kg a lb), el stock, el mínimo, el costo y las recetas se <b>convierten solos</b>.</div>
                        <div class="col-4" id="wrapStock"><label class="form-label small" for="iStock">Stock inicial</label><input id="iStock" type="number" step="0.001" min="0" value="0" class="form-control"></div>
                        <div class="col-4"><label class="form-label small" for="iMin">Stock mínimo</label><input id="iMin" type="number" step="0.001" min="0" value="0" class="form-control"></div>
                        <div class="col-4"><label class="form-label small" for="iCosto">Costo por unidad</label><input id="iCosto" type="number" step="0.01" min="0" value="0" class="form-control"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button><button class="btn btn-rm" type="submit">Guardar</button></div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal receta -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modalReceta" tabindex="-1">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title">Receta: <span id="recetaNombre"></span></h5><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Cerrar"></button></div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <p class="small text-muted">Cantidad de cada insumo que se usa para <b>una unidad</b> del plato. Se descuenta al facturar.</p>
                    <div id="recetaFilas" class="vstack gap-2"></div>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary mt-2" id="recetaAgregar" type="button"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Agregar insumo</button>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-4 mt-3 small">
                        <span>Costo: <b id="recetaCosto" class="num"></b></span>
                        <span>Precio: <b id="recetaPrecio" class="num"></b></span>
                        <span>Margen: <b id="recetaMargen"></b></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button><button class="btn btn-rm" id="recetaGuardar" type="button">Guardar receta</button></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/vendor/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/vendor/sweetalert2/sweetalert2.all.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/inventario.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
